  {
   "id": "city-limits-208438@post-2025-02-27",
   "gameId": "city-limits-208438",
   "displayName": "New languages supported! - French, Spanish, German and Italian",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-27T05:53:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey all! Just got an itch to add a few languages to City Limits. So now City Limits supports French, Spanish, German and Italian.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These translations are most certainly not perfect. To be honest with ya, it was more of a test for myself to see the work involved in setting translating in my games project. Turns out, A. Lot. Of. Work. But since there's probably less then a hundred words in City Limits, it wasn't too bad. And it felt wrong to not upload that work. City Limits doesn't get a ton of traffic so I'm not too worried.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are native speaker of any the above mentioned languages and something's not right, feel free to reach out!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: you may need to do a \"Verify integrity of game files\" after the update. Also this update will erase any current runs in progress. Sorry :(",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That is all! Have fun, leave a review, build some cities, break high scores!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Peace,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Space",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
